    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've noclipped into the Backrooms. </strong><br><strong> </strong><br>The hallway stretches endlessly before you.<br>Fluorescent lights buzz overhead, never ceasing.<br>Every choice brings you deeper into the labyrinth.<br><br><strong>Your survival depends on the paths you choose.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203020/extras/9faf93b1e1fb117529479e98c51be416.poster.avif?t=1742336800\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203020/extras/9faf93b1e1fb117529479e98c51be416.webm?t=1742336800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203020/extras/9faf93b1e1fb117529479e98c51be416.mp4?t=1742336800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms stories is a psychological horror anthology that plunges you into the infamous liminal space known as the Backrooms. Find yourself surrounded by endless yellow wallpaper, the constant buzz of fluorescent lights, and the unsettling feeling that something watches from just beyond your peripheral vision. As you navigate these non-Euclidean spaces, your decisions will shape your fate across five stories.<br> <br>Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Iconic Backrooms environments like Level 0 and the Poolrooms <br>- Multiple branching paths leading to different endings   <br>- Atmospheric sound design that enhances the feeling of isolation <br>- Critical choices that determine your survival        <br>  <br>Will your choices lead you back to reality, or will you become another lost soul, forever wandering the endless expanse of the Backrooms?</p>",
